   - Confirm user has clearance level

4. Review Field-Level Security
   - May be able to see document but not fields

5. Check Audit Log
   - Verify user access attempts
   - Look for permission denials

6. Test with Admin Account
   - If admin can see it, it's permission issue
   - If admin can't, it's document/system issue
```

