### Phase 2: Configuration

**Step 1: Create Metadata Schema**
```
Document Object Configuration:

Standard Fields:
- Name (required, unique)
- Description
- Owner
- Classification

Custom Fields:
Field Name              Type        Required  Indexed
therapeutic_area__v    dropdown    yes       yes
product_name__v       lookup      yes       yes
indication__v         multi-select yes      yes
regulatory_status__v  dropdown    no        yes
expiration_date__v    date        no        yes
required_approvers__v user        yes       no
compliance_level__v   dropdown    yes       yes
version_control__v    checkbox    no        no
```

**Step 2: Configure Lifecycles**
```
Regulatory Document Lifecycle:

Draft
  ├─ Fields editable: All
  ├─ Permissions: Owner, Document Admin
  └─ Transition: Submit for Review (when all required fields filled)

In Review
  ├─ Fields editable: Comments only
  ├─ Permissions: Assigned reviewers
  └─ Transitions:
      ├─ Approve (medical review complete)
      ├─ Reject (return to Draft)
      └─ Request Changes (notify owner)

Approved
  ├─ Fields editable: None (locked)
  ├─ Permissions: View only
  └─ Transition: Publish (to active status)

Published
  ├─ Fields editable: None (read-only)
  ├─ Permissions: All users (read)
  └─ Transitions:
      ├─ Retire (mark as inactive)
      └─ Archive (long-term storage)

Archived
  ├─ Fields editable: None
  ├─ Permissions: Compliance/auditors only
  └─ Note: Immutable record kept for audit
```

**Step 3: Set Up Workflows**
```
Workflow: Multi-Level Approval

State: Draft
  └─ Transition: Submit for Review
     ├─ Condition: [All required fields filled]
     ├─ Action: Notify medical_reviewers group
     ├─ Action: Send email with document link
     └─ Action: Set metadata: submitted_date = TODAY()

State: Medical Review
  ├─ Transition: Medical Approved
  │  ├─ Condition: [User role = Medical Reviewer]
  │  ├─ Action: Update field: medical_approval_date = TODAY()
  │  └─ Next State: QA Review
  │
  └─ Transition: Medical Rejected
     ├─ Action: Notify document owner
     ├─ Action: Add comment: "Medical review failed"
     └─ Next State: Draft

State: QA Review
  ├─ Transition: QA Approved
  │  ├─ Condition: [User role = QA Manager]
  │  ├─ Action: Update field: qa_approval_date = TODAY()
  │  └─ Next State: Ready for Publication
  │
  └─ Transition: QA Rejected
     └─ Next State: Draft

State: Ready for Publication
  └─ Transition: Publish
     ├─ Condition: [All approvals received]
     ├─ Action: Set lifecycle to Published
     ├─ Action: Lock document
     ├─ Action: Generate compliance report
     ├─ Action: Notify all stakeholders
     └─ Action: Archive previous version

State: Published
  └─ Transition: Retire
     ├─ Action: Update status
     ├─ Action: Notify users
     └─ Next State: Archived
```

